"Apple Watch, and watches and rings that sync to Apple Health (Garmin, Oura, WHOOP, Polar, Withings, Amazfit, Huawei, Suunto, Coros…)":"Apple Watch, y relojes y anillos que se sincronizan con Apple Salud (Garmin, Oura, WHOOP, Polar, Withings, Amazfit, Huawei, Suunto, Coros…)",
