"Within the free limit: nobody had to wait.":"Dentro do limite gratuito: ninguém teve de esperar.",
"Phones report a day once they open the app the next day.":"Os telemóveis reportam um dia quando abrem a app no dia seguinte.",
"Apple Watch, and watches and rings that sync to Apple Health (Garmin, Oura, WHOOP, Polar, Withings, Amazfit, Huawei, Suunto, Coros…)":"Apple Watch, e relógios e anéis que sincronizam com a app Saúde (Garmin, Oura, WHOOP, Polar, Withings, Amazfit, Huawei, Suunto, Coros…)",
