"Load the data from your account onto this phone? (Cancel keeps the data on this phone and saves it to your account.)":"要把账户里的数据载入这部手机吗？（取消会保留这部手机上的数据并保存到你的账户。）",
"Signed in":"已登录",
"Account ready. Your data is backed up.":"账户已就绪，数据已备份。",
"Something went wrong. Please try again.":"出了点问题，请重试。",
"Keep your data safe":"保护好你的数据",
"Create a free account with your email and a password. Your data is then backed up every day, and you can get it back on any new phone.":"用邮箱和密码创建一个免费账户。你的数据会每天备份，在任何新手机上都能找回。",
"Account & backup":"账户与备份",
"Backed up automatically every day, encrypted. On a new phone, sign in with this email and password.":"每天自动加密备份。在新手机上用这个邮箱和密码登录即可。",
"Sign out":"退出登录",
"Sign out? Your data stays on this phone, but it is no longer backed up.":"要退出登录吗？数据会留在这部手机上，但不再备份。",
"Signed out":"已退出登录",
"Signed in. Your data is back.":"已登录，你的数据回来了。",
"Your data is on this phone and backed up encrypted in your account. Nutrition values are estimates, not medical advice.":"你的数据保存在这部手机上，并加密备份在你的账户中。营养数值为估算，不构成医疗建议。",
"Privacy":"隐私",
"What happens with your data":"你的数据会怎样",
"Food Tracker is a private app shared among friends and family. This is exactly what happens with your data.":"Food Tracker 是一款在朋友和家人之间分享的私人应用。以下就是你的数据的去向。",
"On your phone":"在你的手机上",
"Your meals, photos, weights, goals, meal plans and coach chats are stored on your phone.":"你的餐食、照片、体重、目标、饮食计划和教练聊天都保存在你的手机上。",
"If you create an account, a copy of your data is saved once a day on the Food Tracker server. It is encrypted with your password before it leaves your phone, so nobody else can read it, not even the app owner. Meal photos are not part of the backup.":"如果你创建账户，你的数据副本每天会在 Food Tracker 服务器上保存一次。数据在离开手机前就用你的密码加密，所以别人都无法读取，应用的主人也不能。餐食照片不在备份中。",
"AI":"AI",
"When you scan food, chat with the coach, use voice input or create a meal plan, that photo, text or recording is sent through the Food Tracker server to Google Gemini to get an answer. The server does not keep it. Google handles it under the Gemini API terms, so please don't send very sensitive things like medical documents.":"当你扫描食物、与教练聊天、使用语音输入或生成饮食计划时，这张照片、文字或录音会通过 Food Tracker 服务器发送给 Google Gemini 以获得回答。服务器不会保存。Google 会按照 Gemini API 条款处理，所以请不要发送病历等非常敏感的内容。",
"If you turn on reminders, the server keeps your phone's notification address, your reminder times and your time zone. Nothing else.":"如果你开启提醒，服务器会保存你手机的通知地址、提醒时间和时区。仅此而已。",
"Barcodes":"条形码",
"When you scan a barcode, only its number is sent to Open Food Facts, a free food database, to find the product.":"扫描条形码时，只会把号码发送给免费的食品数据库 Open Food Facts 来查找商品。",
"What never happens":"绝不会发生的事",
"No ads, no tracking, no selling of data and no emails. Your email address is only the name of your account.":"没有广告、没有追踪、不出售数据，也不发邮件。你的邮箱只是账户的名字。",
"Deleting":"删除",
"Settings → Delete all data removes everything on this phone and your account backup on the server.":"设置 → 删除所有数据 会清除这部手机上的一切以及服务器上的账户备份。",
"Questions? Ask the person who shared the app with you.":"有问题？问问把应用分享给你的人。",
