"Fix: open Shortcuts → <b>Food Tracker calories</b>. In <b>Find Health Samples</b> keep only one date filter: <b>Start Date</b> · <b>is today</b>. Delete other date filters, e.g. a fixed date or <b>in the last 7 days</b>.":"Cara memperbaiki: buka Pintasan → <b>Food Tracker calories</b>. Di <b>Find Health Samples</b> sisakan hanya satu filter tanggal: <b>Start Date</b> · <b>is today</b>. Hapus filter tanggal lain, misalnya tanggal tetap atau <b>in the last 7 days</b>.",
