"If":"Jika",
"If there is no iCloud link: turn on iCloud for Shortcuts in iPhone <b>Settings</b> → your name → <b>iCloud</b>.":"Jika tidak ada tautan iCloud: nyalakan iCloud untuk Pintasan di <b>Pengaturan</b> iPhone → namamu → <b>iCloud</b>.",
"If you connect Apple Health or a tracker, only your calories burned per day are read. For WHOOP, Oura, Polar and Withings the sign-in key is kept on the Food Tracker server, encrypted with a secret that only your phone has. Numbers from the Apple Health Shortcut wait on the server for up to 30 days until your app picks them up.":"Jika kamu menghubungkan Apple Health atau pelacak, hanya kalori terbakar per hari yang dibaca. Untuk WHOOP, Oura, Polar, dan Withings, kunci masuk disimpan di server Food Tracker, terenkripsi dengan rahasia yang hanya dimiliki ponselmu. Angka dari Pintasan Apple Health menunggu di server hingga 30 hari sampai app-mu mengambilnya.",
"If you create an account, a copy of your data and meal photos is saved once a day on the Food Tracker server. It is encrypted with your password before it leaves your phone, so nobody else can read it, not even the app owner.":"Jika kamu membuat akun, salinan data dan foto makananmu disimpan sekali sehari di server Food Tracker. Data dienkripsi dengan kata sandimu sebelum meninggalkan ponsel, jadi tidak ada orang lain yang bisa membacanya, bahkan pemilik app.",
"If you join a group, its members see your name, small profile picture, logging streak and how many days you logged this week, plus your messages. Messages stay on the Food Tracker server for 60 days. Your meals and weight are never shared. Leaving a group removes you from it.":"Jika kamu bergabung ke grup, anggotanya melihat namamu, foto profil kecil, streak pencatatan, dan berapa hari kamu mencatat minggu ini, serta pesan-pesanmu. Pesan disimpan di server Food Tracker selama 60 hari. Makanan dan berat badanmu tidak pernah dibagikan. Keluar dari grup akan menghapusmu dari grup itu.",
"If you live in another country, you keep the consumer rights that the law of your country gives you.":"Jika kamu tinggal di negara lain, kamu tetap memiliki hak konsumen yang diberikan hukum negaramu.",
"If you turn on reminders, the server keeps your phone's notification address, your reminder times and your time zone. Nothing else.":"Jika kamu menyalakan pengingat, server menyimpan alamat notifikasi ponselmu, waktu pengingat, dan zona waktumu. Tidak ada yang lain.",
"In <b>Strava</b>: your profile → <b>Settings</b> (gear) → <b>Applications, Services and Devices</b> → <b>Health</b> → connect it. Strava only shares workouts, so wear your watch all day too if you can.":"Di <b>Strava</b>: profilmu → <b>Settings</b> (roda gigi) → <b>Applications, Services and Devices</b> → <b>Health</b> → hubungkan. Strava hanya membagikan latihan, jadi pakai juga jammu sepanjang hari jika bisa.",
"In Find Health Samples, keep one date row: Start Date · is today. Delete the others.":"Di Find Health Samples, sisakan satu baris tanggal: Start Date · is today. Hapus yang lain.",
"In Get Contents of URL, the end must be the blue Statistics bubble, not typed text.":"Di Get Contents of URL, bagian akhirnya harus gelembung biru Statistics, bukan teks yang diketik.",
"In that action: tap <b>Type</b> → <b>Active Energy</b>. Tap <b>Add Filter</b> → <b>Start Date</b> · <b>is today</b>. Then tap <b>Group By</b> (under <b>Show More</b>) → <b>Day</b>.":"Di tindakan itu: ketuk <b>Type</b> → <b>Active Energy</b>. Ketuk <b>Add Filter</b> → <b>Start Date</b> · <b>is today</b>. Lalu ketuk <b>Group By</b> (di bawah <b>Show More</b>) → <b>Day</b>.",
"In the <b>COROS</b> app: <b>Profile</b> → <b>Settings</b> → <b>3rd Party Apps</b> → <b>Data Sync</b> → <b>Apple Health</b>, and select the data.":"Di app <b>COROS</b>: <b>Profile</b> → <b>Settings</b> → <b>3rd Party Apps</b> → <b>Data Sync</b> → <b>Apple Health</b>, lalu pilih datanya.",
"In the <b>Garmin Connect</b> app: <b>More</b> (bottom right) → <b>Settings</b> → <b>Connected Apps</b> → <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Connect with Apple Health</b>, then allow the data, especially <b>Active Energy</b>.":"Di app <b>Garmin Connect</b>: <b>More</b> (kanan bawah) → <b>Settings</b> → <b>Connected Apps</b> → <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Connect with Apple Health</b>, lalu izinkan datanya, terutama <b>Active Energy</b>.",
"In the <b>Mi Fitness</b> app: <b>Profile</b> → <b>Third-party data</b> → turn on <b>Health</b> and select the data, especially <b>Active Energy</b>.":"Di app <b>Mi Fitness</b>: <b>Profile</b> → <b>Third-party data</b> → nyalakan <b>Health</b> dan pilih datanya, terutama <b>Active Energy</b>.",
"In the <b>Oura</b> app: the menu (☰, top left) → <b>Settings</b> → under <b>Data sharing</b> tap <b>Apple Health</b> → turn on <b>Connect to Health</b>.":"Di app <b>Oura</b>: menu (☰, kiri atas) → <b>Settings</b> → di bawah <b>Data sharing</b> ketuk <b>Apple Health</b> → nyalakan <b>Connect to Health</b>.",
"In the <b>Polar Flow</b> app: <b>More</b> (bottom right) → <b>General settings</b> → turn on <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Turn On All</b> → <b>Allow</b>.":"Di app <b>Polar Flow</b>: <b>More</b> (kanan bawah) → <b>General settings</b> → nyalakan <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Turn On All</b> → <b>Allow</b>.",
"In the <b>Suunto</b> app: <b>Settings</b> → turn on <b>Save to Apple Health</b> and allow the data.":"Di app <b>Suunto</b>: <b>Settings</b> → nyalakan <b>Save to Apple Health</b> dan izinkan datanya.",
"In the <b>WHOOP</b> app: <b>More</b> → <b>App Settings</b> → <b>Integrations</b> → <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Connect</b>, and turn everything on.":"Di app <b>WHOOP</b>: <b>More</b> → <b>App Settings</b> → <b>Integrations</b> → <b>Apple Health</b> → <b>Connect</b>, lalu nyalakan semuanya.",
"In the <b>Withings</b> app: <b>Profile</b> → scroll to <b>Apps</b> → tap <b>Health</b> → <b>Activate</b> → <b>Next</b> → <b>Turn On All</b>.":"Di app <b>Withings</b>: <b>Profile</b> → gulir ke <b>Apps</b> → ketuk <b>Health</b> → <b>Activate</b> → <b>Next</b> → <b>Turn On All</b>.",
"In the <b>Zepp</b> app: <b>Profile</b> (bottom right) → <b>Add accounts</b> → <b>Health</b> → turn on all data, especially <b>Active Energy</b>.":"Di app <b>Zepp</b>: <b>Profile</b> (kanan bawah) → <b>Add accounts</b> → <b>Health</b> → nyalakan semua data, terutama <b>Active Energy</b>.",
"In the Shortcuts app, tap <b>Automation</b> (bottom), then <b>+</b> (top right) or <b>New Automation</b>.":"Di app Pintasan, ketuk <b>Otomatisasi</b> (bawah), lalu <b>+</b> (kanan atas) atau <b>Otomatisasi Baru</b>.",
"In the Shortcuts list, press and hold <b>Food Tracker calories</b> → <b>Share</b> → <b>Copy iCloud Link</b>.":"Di daftar Pintasan, tekan lama <b>Food Tracker calories</b> → <b>Bagikan</b> → <b>Salin Tautan iCloud</b>.",
"In the last action, after code= there must be the blue Text bubble.":"Di tindakan terakhir, setelah code= harus ada gelembung biru Text.",
"In the last action, delete the text [Statistics] after kcal= and tap Statistics in the bar above the keyboard. It must be a blue bubble.":"Di tindakan terakhir, hapus teks [Statistics] setelah kcal= lalu ketuk Statistics di bilah atas papan ketik. Harus berupa gelembung biru.",
"Included. Photos and messages are processed by Google Gemini.":"Termasuk. Foto dan pesan diproses oleh Google Gemini.",
