"Tip: add a second one, e.g. at 14:00, so the number also updates during the day.":"Tips: tambahkan satu lagi, misalnya pukul 14:00, agar angkanya juga diperbarui di siang hari.",
"To know how many people use Food Tracker, the app sends a random number, the first and last day it was used and how many AI requests it made. With an account, this is stored together with your account. It never contains your food or photos.":"Untuk mengetahui berapa orang yang memakai Food Tracker, app mengirim nomor acak, hari pertama dan terakhir dipakai, serta jumlah permintaan AI. Jika punya akun, ini disimpan bersama akunmu. Tidak pernah berisi makanan atau fotomu.",
